                        "review": "Interesting shooter with cute grafx. \n\nYou use both controll sticks. One to steer around, one to aim. \nSome targets will destroy the sugar walls you laboriously build up to protect your sugarmuffin, others will lick your girlfriend ...ehrrrrrrmmm... to death. \n\nYour ammo is based on candy. There is not too much of it flying around, so be carefull with your aim. You also can use sugarbricks, flying bombs or the shop items to stop the licking orgy. \n\nAlltogether it's not an too easy game, which demands not only skills but also a litte bit of strategy. You surely don't wanna end up in front of the Boss without any ammo left. \n\nWhat I am missing is a bit more tutorial help. Took a little bit of time to figure out everything by myself. \n\nBirdcakes is definitely much better, strategic and slobber-juiced than asteroids.",
